codex123
========

codex123 is an independent, unofficial project derived from CodexPlusPlus:

  https://github.com/BigPizzaV3/CodexPlusPlus

The original CodexPlusPlus project provided the external launcher, manager,
Chromium DevTools Protocol injection approach, installer layout, and much of
the foundation that makes this project possible. codex123 keeps this lineage
visible out of respect for the original project and its contributors.

codex123 adds a remote-control-compatible relay mode, macOS arm64 focused
packaging, and project branding aimed at a development-experience-first Codex
workflow.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by OpenAI.
Codex, ChatGPT, and related product names belong to their respective owners.

codex123 does not modify the original Codex App installation files. It starts
Codex through an external launcher and injects enhancement scripts through the
Chromium DevTools Protocol.

The mobile ChatGPT remote-control entry point, account eligibility, and remote
session availability are controlled by OpenAI. codex123 only aims to preserve
local configuration conditions that do not break the official ChatGPT login
state.
